    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectApproached? THEN\n\t\t\tDO GrabObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveObjectToDestination\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsDestinationReached? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO ProcessObject\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
